{%- comment -%}
  horizon-blocks Phase 10 — hz-product-list host (port of stock Horizon
  v4.1.1 (68760d9) sections/product-list.liquid; hz- filename per the
  host-family precedent — the schema/preset names stay stock). Deviations:
  - Standalone-host preamble (hz-carousel precedent): component-group.css +
    hz-type-variables + hz-ui-tokens.
  - card_hover_effect is a SECTION setting here (stock's is a THEME setting
    driving a body class, theme.liquid:41 — settings_schema is frozen and
    new-alongside means no Dawn body edits). Options mirror stock
    (none/lift/scale/subtle-zoom); DEFAULT 'none' deviates from stock's
    'lift' per Nathan's punchlist ruling (2026-07-05: "not a fan... gate
    behind a setting"). hz-blocks-host carries no hover class at all
    (= none) — public cards there don't lift.
  - LOCKSMITH GATE in the real-product loop (leak prevention,
    sections/main-collection-product-grid.liquid:385-389 pattern) + the
    split marker restructured prefix-style so gated products can't leave an
    empty carousel slide (see loop comments). slide_count is passed as
    list_items_array.size instead of max_items so carousel controls track
    the POST-gate count (stock's max_items overcounts whenever the
    collection is short, and would also overcount gated items).
  - Phase 14: the 'editorial' layout_type option + products_editorial
    preset RE-ADDED (the editorial-grid snippets landed with the
    collection-list slice; resource-list re-adds the matching dispatch
    arms). PRESET DEVIATION (Nathan's ruling 2026-07-08): the preset's
    card tree MIRRORS this file's Grid/Carousel preset card
    (custom/0.75rem type, color_suffix: true, _product-badges child under
    Media) instead of stock's paragraph/1rem/h6 tree — live-Dawn card
    parity beats stock-preset parity; preset-LEVEL settings (max_products
    4, gap 64, layout_type editorial) stay stock.
  - Phase-11 M&P bridge (NOT stock): hide_sold_out setting (Dawn
    featured-collection parity, skip placed with the Locksmith gate),
    show_section_tag product-template gate (featured-collection.liquid:117-123
    pattern, retargeted to the platform section wrapper), presets nest a
    _product-badges child under each Media entry, and preset product_title
    entries set color_suffix: true (live-Dawn card-title parity).
  - The appended stylesheet: Dawn adaptation of Horizon's .section grid
    scoped to .section-resource-list (hz-carousel's .section-carousel
    adaptation, same store-specific reduction) + the .force-full-width leg
    (base.css:418, re-scoped) + the .section-resource-list support rules
    (base.css:3605-3633 subset, verbatim).
  - Schema/preset t: strings hardcoded to Horizon's English.
  - Phase 13 (quick-add seam closed; round 3 = DAWN-NATIVE, Nathan ruling
    2026-07-07): quick_add SECTION setting (stock's is a THEME setting — the
    card_hover_effect promotion precedent above; DEFAULT FALSE deviates from
    stock's true = live M&P cards render no quick-add by default). When on,
    this host loads DAWN's quick-add assets (quick-add.css + quick-add.js +
    product-form.js — the main-collection-product-grid.liquid:13-20 grid
    pattern) and blocks/_product-card-gallery renders Dawn's per-card
    trigger + modal (snippets/hz-card-quick-add — extraction of Dawn
    card-product.liquid:148-243; its header carries the ruling). No
    mobile_quick_add setting and no modal singleton (the round-1/2 Horizon
    shapes): Dawn's trigger is server-side gated + always visible at both
    breakpoints, and Dawn modals are per-card. The Horizon quick-add
    subsystem stays in-repo, unwired from M&P card surfaces.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Host-owned dependencies (precedent: sections/hz-blocks-host.liquid — "future
  hosts render both"): the frozen Phase-0 engine CSS the card/text/group
  children depend on, plus the type + UI token layers. hz-product-list is a
  standalone host, so it cannot rely on hz-blocks-host being on the page.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'component-group.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{% render 'hz-type-variables' %}
{% render 'hz-ui-tokens' %}

{%- comment -%}
  Phase 13 round 3 — DAWN's quick-add machinery, loaded exactly like the
  live grids (main-collection-product-grid.liquid:13-20 /
  featured-collection.liquid:11-17). No modal singleton: Dawn modals are
  per-card (snippets/hz-card-quick-add, rendered by _product-card-gallery).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if section.settings.quick_add -%}
  {{ 'quick-add.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  <script src="{{ 'quick-add.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
  <script src="{{ 'product-form.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{%- endif -%}

{% liquid
  assign max_items = section.settings.max_products
  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id
  endif
%}

{% comment %}
  Phase-11 M&P bridge — Dawn featured-collection.liquid:117-123 parity: on
  product templates, an instance with show_section_tag set hides itself
  unless the product carries that tag (PDP-embedded instances self-gate).
  Targets the platform section wrapper (hz sections don't emit Dawn's
  .section-{{ section.id }} class).
{% endcomment %}
{%- if template contains 'product' and section.settings.show_section_tag != blank -%}
  {%- unless product.tags contains section.settings.show_section_tag -%}
    {% style %}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
        display: none;
      }
    {% endstyle %}
  {%- endunless -%}
{%- endif -%}

<div
  class="section-background{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
></div>
<div
  data-testid="product-list"
  class="
    section
    section--{{ section.settings.section_width }}
    {% if section.settings.background_color != blank %}color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}
    section-resource-list
    card-hover-effect-{{ section.settings.card_hover_effect | default: 'none' }}
    spacing-style
    gap-style
  "
  style="
    {% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}
    {% render 'gap-style', value: section.settings.gap %}
  "
>
  <div class="section-resource-list__header">
    {%- content_for 'block', type: '_product-list-content', id: 'static-header' -%}
  </div>

  {% comment %}
    theme-check-disable UniqueStaticBlockId — the repeated
    static-product-card id is stock Horizon's own pattern (one static block
    definition, re-rendered per product; only one of the if/else branches
    executes). Upload validation accepts it; the lint rule doesn't model
    loops/branches.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% comment %}theme-check-disable UniqueStaticBlockId{% endcomment %}
  {% capture list_items %}
    {% if section.settings.collection != blank and shop.products_count != 0 %}
      {% assign hz_rendered_count = 0 %}
      {% paginate section.settings.collection.products by max_items %}
        {% for product in section.settings.collection.products limit: max_items %}
          {% comment %}
            Phase-10 LOCKSMITH GATE (leak prevention) — the
            sections/main-collection-product-grid.liquid:385-389 pattern:
            locked products must not surface in hz lists for sessions that
            fail the lock. Gated products still consume loop slots (the
            section shows fewer than max_products), matching the native
            grid's behavior.
          {% endcomment %}
          {%- capture lock_content -%}{%- render 'locksmith-v2-lock-product' product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {% assign lock_content = lock_content | strip %}
          {% if lock_content == 'true' %}
            {% continue %}
          {% endif %}
          {% comment %}
            Phase-11 M&P bridge — Dawn featured-collection parity: optional
            sold-out skip (its simple `available == false` form; the
            keep-Coming-Soon variant is metafield-product-slider's, PDP
            track). Placed like the Locksmith gate, before the prefix split
            marker, so skips can't leave an empty carousel slide.
          {% endcomment %}
          {% if section.settings.hide_sold_out and product.available == false %}
            {% continue %}
          {% endif %}
          {% comment %}
            Dawn deviation from stock's `unless forloop.last` suffix marker:
            the split marker is emitted BEFORE every rendered item except the
            first, so a gated (skipped) product can't leave a trailing
            marker — a trailing marker would split into an empty chunk and
            render as an empty carousel slide.
          {% endcomment %}
          {% if hz_rendered_count > 0 %}<!--@list/split-->{% endif %}
        <div
          class="resource-list__item"
        >
            {% content_for 'block',
              type: '_product-card',
              id: 'static-product-card',
              closest.product: product,
              product_view_context: 'collection'
            %}
          </div>
          {% assign hz_rendered_count = hz_rendered_count | plus: 1 %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endpaginate %}
    {% else %}
      {% for i in (1..max_items) %}
        <div
          class="resource-list__item"
        >
            {% content_for 'block', type: '_product-card', id: 'static-product-card', closest.product: null %}
        </div>

        {% unless forloop.last %}
          <!--@list/split-->
        {% endunless %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endcapture %}

  {% comment %}theme-check-enable UniqueStaticBlockId{% endcomment %}
  {% liquid
    # Create an array from the list items to be used for different layout types
    assign list_items_array = list_items | strip | split: '<!--@list/split-->'
  %}

  {% render 'resource-list',
    list_items: list_items,
    list_items_array: list_items_array,
    settings: section.settings,
    slide_count: list_items_array.size,
    content_type: 'products',
    test_id: 'resource-list-grid'
  %}

  <div
    class="section-resource-list__content"
    style="--horizontal-alignment: {{ section.settings.horizontal_alignment }};"
  >
    {%- content_for 'blocks' -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Dawn adaptation of Horizon base.css .section grid (68760d9
     base.css:333-419), scoped to .section-resource-list — copied from the
     hz-carousel host's .section-carousel adaptation (same store-specific
     reduction: .page-width max-width is disabled, so
     --util-page-margin-offset === the page padding; gutters follow Dawn's
     1100px page-padding breakpoint). */
  .section-resource-list {
    --util-page-margin-offset: var(--page-width-padding);
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(var(--util-page-margin-offset), 1fr)
      minmax(0, calc(100% - var(--util-page-margin-offset) * 2))
      minmax(var(--util-page-margin-offset), 1fr);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1099px) {
    .section-resource-list {
      --util-page-margin-offset: var(--mobile-page-width-padding);
    }
  }

  .section-resource-list > * {
    grid-column: 2;
  }

  .section-resource-list.section--full-width > * {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  /* Horizon base.css:418 leg, re-scoped from `.section >` to this host's
     section class: carousel layouts break out to the full page width. */
  .section-resource-list > .force-full-width {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  /* Horizon base.css:3605-3633 extraction (subset, verbatim): the section's
     row gap, the content/header empty-state collapse. The
     data-product-transition leg is inert (view transitions hardcoded off)
     but kept verbatim. */
  .section-resource-list {
    row-gap: var(--gap);
  }

  .section-resource-list__content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: var(--horizontal-alignment);
    gap: var(--gap);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .section-resource-list__content:empty {
    display: none;
  }

  .section-resource-list__header:is(:empty, :has(.group-block-content:empty)),
  .section-resource-list__content:empty {
    display: none;
  }

  :where(.section-resource-list.section--full-width) product-card[data-product-transition] > .group-block {
    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      padding-inline: max(var(--padding-xs), var(--padding-inline-start))
        max(var(--padding-xs), var(--padding-inline-end));
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured collection",
  "class": "ui-test-product-list",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@theme"
    },
    {
      "type": "@app"
    },
    {
      "type": "_divider"
    }
  ],
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header", "footer"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout_type",
      "label": "Type",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "grid",
          "label": "Grid"
        },
        {
          "value": "carousel",
          "label": "Carousel"
        },
        {
          "value": "editorial",
          "label": "Editorial"
        }
      ],
      "default": "grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "carousel_on_mobile",
      "label": "Carousel on mobile",
      "default": false,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type != 'carousel' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_products",
      "label": "Product count",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 16,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "hide_sold_out",
      "label": "Hide sold-out products",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "show_section_tag",
      "label": "Show section only for product tag",
      "info": "On product pages, hides this section unless the product has this tag"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns",
      "label": "Columns",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 8,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type != 'editorial' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "mobile_columns",
      "label": "Mobile columns",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "1",
          "label": "1"
        },
        {
          "value": "2",
          "label": "2"
        }
      ],
      "default": "2",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'grid' and section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == false }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "mobile_card_size",
      "label": "Mobile columns",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "60cqw",
          "label": "1"
        },
        {
          "value": "44cqw",
          "label": "2"
        }
      ],
      "default": "60cqw",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' or section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == true }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns_gap",
      "label": "Horizontal gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'grid' or section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "rows_gap",
      "label": "Vertical gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'grid'}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Carousel navigation",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' or section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == true }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "icons_style",
      "label": "Icon",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "arrow",
          "label": "Arrows"
        },
        {
          "value": "chevron",
          "label": "Chevrons"
        },
        {
          "value": "arrows_large",
          "label": "Large arrows"
        },
        {
          "value": "chevron_large",
          "label": "Large chevrons"
        },
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "None"
        }
      ],
      "default": "arrow",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' or section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == true }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "icons_shape",
      "label": "Icon background",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "None"
        },
        {
          "value": "circle",
          "label": "Circle"
        },
        {
          "value": "square",
          "label": "Square"
        }
      ],
      "default": "none",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.icons_style != 'none' and section.settings.layout_type == 'carousel' or section.settings.carousel_on_mobile == true }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "Width",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "page-width",
          "label": "Page"
        },
        {
          "value": "full-width",
          "label": "Full"
        }
      ],
      "default": "page-width"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "horizontal_alignment",
      "label": "Alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "flex-start",
          "label": "Left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "Center"
        },
        {
          "value": "flex-end",
          "label": "Right"
        }
      ],
      "default": "flex-start"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "Gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "placeholder": "Default"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "card_hover_effect",
      "label": "Card hover effect",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "None"
        },
        {
          "value": "lift",
          "label": "Lift"
        },
        {
          "value": "scale",
          "label": "Scale"
        },
        {
          "value": "subtle-zoom",
          "label": "Subtle zoom"
        }
      ],
      "default": "none"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Quick add"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "quick_add",
      "label": "Quick add",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Featured collection: Grid",
      "category": "Products",
      "settings": {
        "collection": "",
        "max_products": 8,
        "layout_type": "grid",
        "carousel_on_mobile": false,
        "columns": 4,
        "mobile_columns": "2",
        "columns_gap": 8,
        "rows_gap": 24,
        "icons_style": "arrow",
        "icons_shape": "none",
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "gap": 28,
